          "text": "<!-- qwen-release-notes:v1 --> ## Highlights - Managed-agent sessions can hold multiple child questions at once, answer them in any order, and keep drafts and errors separated per child. ([#16484](https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16484)) - Web Shell adds a task Q&A heatmap and an Ask for details side task that explains pending Ask User Question options without answering. ([#16037](https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16037), [#16458](https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/pull/16458)) - GitHub channel editor adds Repository Filter allowlists and blocklists, while bound PR delivery an…"
